      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR. ULMA (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (24.28) last time in a Grade 5 at Traralgon. Has a good record at this journey. Has ability and is a key runner. INTRIGUE (7) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 2 length second (22.39) over 390m at Shepparton. The form out of her last race has been franked. Will give a great sight again. DR. LEVIATE (6) turned in a solid run last start over 400m at Warragul finishing 4th and beaten only 2.25 lengths (23.48). Returns to favourable track. Form from her last run is proving strong. Has the ability to give this a shake. MABEL LEE ROSE (1) cannot be ruled out.",
